      "created_at": "2026-01-22T09:27:11.553Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is an integration for <a href=\"https://www.sumup.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">SumUp</a> card payment terminals if you’re looking for that.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox githubrepo\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/Rocket-Quack/erpnext_sumup\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Rocket-Quack/erpnext_sumup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\" data-github-private-repo=\"false\">\n  <img width=\"690\" height=\"344\" src=\"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/7cbd06682c2d41272d50bb946d566292/Rocket-Quack/erpnext_sumup\" class=\"thumbnail\">\n\n  <h3><a href=\"https://github.com/Rocket-Quack/erpnext_sumup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GitHub - Rocket-Quack/erpnext_sumup: SumUP integration for ERPNext POS. Initiate card...</a></h3>\n\n    <p><span class=\"github-repo-description\">SumUP integration for ERPNext POS. Initiate card payments directly via the POS interface, check status, and post transactions cleanly in ERPNext for fast, reliable checkout. </span></p>\n</div>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Or would you like to connect another POS system to ERPNext for inventory management only?</p>",
