      "created_at": "2026-01-23T01:30:36.181Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the input! I appreciate it, truly!</p>\n<p>Basically I’d like the ERPNext/Frappe to be the single source of truth for virtually all of the customer data (especially inventory and accounting), and I’d like a POS/payment terminal integration that is as seamless as possible whereby the POS/terminal talks to the ERP when a payment is made.</p>\n<p>ERPNext/Frappe POS can do this native with the huge exception that there’s no way (that I know of) to get a payment terminal to “talk” to ERPNext, so all of the accounting/data entry for the payments must be done manually.</p>",
